      "step1Title": "Step 1 · State (recognise)",
      "step1Body": "You have many things you'd like to do and plenty of ability,\nand still no place that feels like the one to stand in.",
      "step2Title": "Step 2 · Allow (the core)",
      "step2Body": "I allow the exploring to continue, without rushing to be certain.",
