      "therapist": "If you are using this card with a practitioner:\n* Keep your voice quiet and respectful; avoid urging them to \"engage a bit more\"\n\n* Watch for the breath becoming perceptible, the body's weight being felt again\n\n* You might say: \"You don't have to feel anything now. This is fine too.\"\n\nWhen you use MUNI Scent together:\nIn a shared scent environment, the body finds it easier to allow feeling back,\nso vitality isn't pulled up — it flows back on its own."
